ital”) entered into certain share conversion documents (the “Conversion Documents”), pursuant to which, the Company agreed to issue to Burgeon Capital and Burgeon Capital agreed to subscribe from the Company, the Converted Shares, as the repayment by the Company to Burgeon Capital of all outstanding principal amount and accrued interest under the promissory note issued to Burgeon Capital on December 28, 2023, with a total amount of US$27,342,000.","section":"ITEM 4. INFORMATION ON THE COMPANY","block":554,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001213900-26-004379","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-01-14","reportDate":"2025-09-30","cik":"0001769256","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1769256/000121390026004379/ea0270582-20f_xchange.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/000a3dbdacc5ba6c78dd82f39a8c292b07ce3d6d12d4541025438a5a8a535524.bin","sha256":"000a3dbdacc5ba6c78dd82f39a8c292b07ce3d6d12d4541025438a5a8a535524"}},{"id":"56e97a0825ca89969ea5c97b425a3ba977279cf3341afae64bcb513c02716c20","quote":"Effective on November 8, 2024, we adjusted the ratio of ADS from one (1) ADS representing six hundred thousand (600,000) Class A ordinary shares to one (1) ADS representing twelve million (12,000,000) Class A ordinary shares.","context":"On October 24, 2024, Mr. Yong Zhang purchased from Mr. Chengcai Qu, the then sole shareholder and sole director of Golden Stream, all issued and outstanding ordinary shares held by Mr. Qu in Golden Stream, and became the sole shareholder and sole director of Golden Stream.","section":"ITEM 4. INFORMATION ON THE COMPANY","block":555,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001213900-26-004379","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-01-14","reportDate":"2025-09-30","cik":"0001769256","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1769256/000121390026004379/ea0270582-20f_xchange.h